# Test: OSPFv3 guarded native LSA inject + observe + withdraw.
#
# VALIDATES: spec-ospf-ext-14 -- `debug ipv6 ospf inject lsa ...` originates a v3 LSA via the base seam (scope from S2/S1, reserved rejected), it appears in the database, and withdraw MaxAge-flushes it (AC-14/AC-15/AC-18).
# PREVENTS: a regression in the OSPF debug/introspection surface.
#
# Live FRR/QEMU multicast convergence is owned by the ospf-debug-*-frr interop scenarios.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=go test -v ./internal/plugins/ospf -run TestDebugInjectV3LSAFloods|TestV3InjectWithdrawFlushes|TestV3InjectReservedScopeRejected|TestV3InjectBodyOverflowRejected -count=1:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=TestDebugInjectV3LSAFloods
expect=stdout:contains=TestV3InjectWithdrawFlushes
expect=stdout:contains=TestV3InjectReservedScopeRejected
expect=stdout:contains=PASS
